{"id":"56a0ce4b212a48f4","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pbposiconstant.md","title":"Posiform常数下界的最优可达性","display":"thm-pbposiconstant — Posiform常数下界的最优可达性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pbposiconstant","aliases":["27-thm-pbposiconstant"],"display":"thm-pbposiconstant — Posiform常数下界的最优可达性","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbnf]]","[[27-df-pbopt]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.4.4","source_printed_pages":"590","source_pdf_pages":"614","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pbposiconstant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pbposiconstant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pbposiconstant — Posiform常数下界的最优可达性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.4.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"590"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"614"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-local-argument"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBEval}_n,\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PBEval}_n,\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a>，有限立方体极值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Const}:\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(\\operatorname{Const}:\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mu\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(c,\\sigma)\">\\((c,\\sigma)\\)</span> 采用该 Posiform 定义的有序对编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Const}((c,\\sigma))\\coloneqq c\\quad((c,\\sigma)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n),\\qquad\\mu\\coloneqq\\min_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Const}((c,\\sigma))\\coloneqq c\\quad((c,\\sigma)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n),\\qquad\\mu\\coloneqq\\min_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\quad\n(\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)=f\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Const}(P)\\le\\mu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\quad\n(\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)=f\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Const}(P)\\le\\mu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists P\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\quad\n(\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)=f\\land\\operatorname{Const}(P)=\\mu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists P\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\quad\n(\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)=f\\land\\operatorname{Const}(P)=\\mu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>下界由所有非常数项非负得到。对每个顶点a取全赋值minterm，系数为f(a)−μ，仅保留严格正项，常数取μ。这些minterm两两不相交并恰覆盖正差值顶点，故重构f。n=0时取m=0。这给出原书留作练习断言的一般构造，不声称指数大小表示能高效求得。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbopt]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{PBEval}_n,\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbnf]]，有限立方体极值见 [[27-df-pbopt]]。$\\operatorname{Const}:\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\to\\mathbb R$ 与 $\\mu\\in\\mathbb R$ 由下式定义；$(c,\\sigma)$ 采用该 Posiform 定义的有序对编码。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$\\mathrm{PBEval}_n,\\mathrm{Posiform}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbnf]]，有限立方体极值见 [[27-df-pbopt]]。$\\operatorname{Const}:\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\to\\mathbb R$ 与 $\\mu\\in\\mathbb R$ 由下式定义；$(c,\\sigma)$ 采用该 Posiform 定义的有序对编码。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBEval}_n,\\mathrm{Posiform}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Const}:\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"(c,\\sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Const}((c,\\sigma))\\coloneqq c\\quad((c,\\sigma)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n),\\qquad\\mu\\coloneqq\\min_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n}f(x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\quad\n(\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)=f\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Const}(P)\\le\\mu).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists P\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n\\quad\n(\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P)=f\\land\\operatorname{Const}(P)=\\mu).","display":true}],"bytes":1706,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-142","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pbposiconstant|thm-pbposiconstant — Posiform常数下界的最优可达性]]"}],"outgoing":["34c60c3bc15859dd","a668791f62b82e2a"]}